     "relecture": "traduction automatique, non relue"
    },
    "fuf": {
     "texte": "Laamiiɗo mawɗo ɗon umri yimɓe, ammaa lesdi wonaako nyaamdu. A wi'i mo: ko haani o wallina on, koo yahde to mawɗo mawɗo ɗon wolwugo bee sarɗiiji?",
     "relecture": "traduction automatique, non relue"
